    "generate_outline": "Design and build a custom calculator. Begin with a lightning pitch to a partner, pressure-testing the formula's inputs and output. Use AI to source the real-world formula behind the topic, documenting acceptance or rejection of AI suggestions. Build the calculator on the five-step scaffold (comment, explanation, inputs, expressions, result). The program must use at least four different arithmetic operators, and use `%` or `round()` at least once to serve the user. Self-annotate with scaffold numbers. If time allows, perform a cold swap with a partner for feedback. Reflect on the calculator's function, formula origin, tradeoffs, and debugging."
